KFG         : 0.42  : Autocatalytic follicular growth rate (1/d)
REC         : 0.030 : Zero-order follicular recruitment (1/d)
KFSH_M      : 1.20  : Half-saturation of the follicular FSH response
FSH_THR     : 0.90  : FSH recruitment threshold
